 Stoecker, Kilian and Fleischmann, Erna and Gabriel, Martin and Weller, Simon A and Koivogui, Lamine and Diallo, Boubacar and Keita, Sakoba and Rambaut, Andrew and Formenty, Pierre and Gunther, Stephan and Carroll, Miles W},
